_:b163_b0 <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <https://ref.gs1.org/epcis/EPCISDocument> .
_:b163_b0 <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "" .
_:b163_b0 <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Architecture: the event references identifiers by URI — GTIN in epcList, GLN in readPoint/bizLocation, party GLN in source/destination. Model-, location-, and party-level master data is served by the GS1 Digital Link / Web Vocabulary resolver when those URIs are dereferenced; it is NOT embedded in the event." .
_:b163_b0 <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "GS1 demo prefix 952 (7-digit GCP: 9521234)." .
_:b163_b0 <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "HTTP header: GS1-Extensions: oec=https://ref.openepcis.org/extensions/common/core/,euelec=https://ref.openepcis.org/extensions/eu/electronics/" .
_:b163_b0 <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "See: extensions/common/core/docs/EPCIS_MASTERDATA_AND_EXTENSIONS.md" .
_:b163_b0 <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "The battery chemistry is model-level master data of the battery GTIN (eubat:hasBatteryChemistry, served by the resolver), so the treatment event records only what the operator did with the battery: mass, separate treatment, treatment route and facility." .
_:b163_b0 <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "WEEE end-of-life chain: collection (OBSERVE), sorting/inspection (OBSERVE)," .
_:b163_b0 <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "masterDataAvailableFor carries ONLY item/lot-level master data (e.g. countryOfOrigin, regulatoryInformation, harvestDate, EUDR plot geolocation). ilmd carries lot/instance data of the items this event creates. Observation extensions sit at event level." .
_:b163_b0 <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#versionInfo> "2.0" .
